[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16083.67, "timestamp": "04:28:03", "text": "嗯？等待。她走了，兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16086.87, "timestamp": "04:28:06", "text": "哦，你好，欧。是的。你好。欢迎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16089.75, "timestamp": "04:28:09", "text": "欢迎。你好吗？乔克正在服用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16091.349, "timestamp": "04:28:11", "text": "现在绕道去房子，因为他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16094.309, "timestamp": "04:28:14", "text": "我已死去，但我仍在努力活下去。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16101.349, "timestamp": "04:28:21", "text": "是的。我什么都做不了。我可以拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16103.83, "timestamp": "04:28:23", "text": "现在就这么坐着，什么都别碰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16107.269, "timestamp": "04:28:27", "text": "我的键盘。乔克，你今天过得怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16110.309, "timestamp": "04:28:30", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16113.51, "timestamp": "04:28:33", "text": "但是，也千万别吓得尿裤子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16116.71, "timestamp": "04:28:36", "text": "是的，我听到了。她来了。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16124.07, "timestamp": "04:28:44", "text": "我们。我能听到她的声音。回来。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16126.95, "timestamp": "04:28:46", "text": "她朝我走过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16134.389, "timestamp": "04:28:54", "text": "回到我身边。对，就待在那儿。停留"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16137.189, "timestamp": "04:28:57", "text": "那里。待在那儿，看看她会不会来。"}]